      "message": "fix(ui): operation picking is a mode - other tabs lock the selection\n\nViewport clicks change an operation's geometry only on its Geometry tab\n(or with a pick row armed). Elsewhere the click is swallowed, hover and the\npick box stand down, and the dialog says Picking on / off.\n\nFixes #1514\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
